.TH METADESK-MANAGER 1 "November 2026" "Metadesk 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
metadesk-manager \- graphical manager for Metadesk accounts, hosts and access
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B metadesk-manager
.RB [ \-\-management-socket
.IR PATH ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Open the Metadesk Manager to configure local accounts, manage saved hosts and
launch the video client. To manage access for a running local host, connect to
its private management socket. The manager does not start a host daemon.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-help
Print command-line options and exit.
.TP
.BI \-\-management-socket= PATH
Connect to a running local host's private management socket at
.IR PATH .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR metadesk-host (1),
.BR metadesk-client (1)
